Model "Blur Gray".

Blur Gray is a process {description: "Converts an image to grey and blurs it."} [role: composite, type: blur_gray].
Blur Gray zooms into Cvt Color Node, then Gaussian Blur Node, as well as Code Const and Gray.

Blur Gray Img is an object [role: value, value_kind: input].

Blur Gray Out is an object [role: value, value_kind: output].

Code Const is an object [role: value, value_kind: const, value: "COLOR_BGR2GRAY"].

Cvt Color Node is a process [role: node, type: cv_cvt_color, path: body.img].
Cvt Color Node yields Gray.
Cvt Color Node requires Blur Gray Img [arg: img, arg_index: 0].
Cvt Color Node requires Code Const [arg: code, arg_index: 1].

Gaussian Blur Node is a process [role: node, type: cv_gaussian_blur, path: body].
Gaussian Blur Node yields Blur Gray Out.
Gaussian Blur Node requires Gray [arg: img, arg_index: 0].

Gray is an object [role: value, value_kind: intermediate].
